# Inkpath

!!#PK#Vector# ++GL~Inkpath++ is a vector graphics editor with box selection, live Bézier point dragging, and panning and zooming around the canvas. Drawings are saved as `.kv` files and export as SVG or PNG!

[Open Inkpath](/inkpath) · [Phone version](/inkpath/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Inkpath|red}
## Drawing tools

* !!(R#Selection# with a drag box for several shapes at once!
* !!(R#Path tools# with real-time Bézier node dragging, and a ++GL~knife++ for cutting!
* !!(R#Gradient tool# (press ++GL~G++) with fill-line handles. Hold Shift to snap!
* !!(R#Rulers, guides and snapping#, plus ++GL~align++, ++GL~layers++ and ++GL~artboards++!

## Blur Behind

++GL~Blur Behind++ turns a shape into frosted glass by blurring everything behind it. The effect survives export!

## Animation

The ++GL~Animate++ panel adds keyframes:

1. Set a keyframe!
2. Move a shape!
3. Move the playhead and set another keyframe!

You can also use presets like Fade in, Spin or Bounce. Export an SVG that plays by itself in any browser!

## Saving and exporting

Choose **File > Export** for SVG or PNG. Extra SVG features such as caps, dashes, markers, patterns, blend modes, groups and images are supported!
